{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/027",
  "family": "NOR10"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u07329",
   "en": "What's on your mind, Lieutenant?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07330",
   "en": "Well, well, you're a romantic. Did you sign on for \"the dream,\" Alenko? Secure man's future in space?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07331",
   "en": "I didn't go through BAaT training for my biotics. Tell me about it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07332",
   "en": "Seems like you beat the odds. How many didn't make it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07333",
   "en": "\"Jump Zero\" is Gagarin Station, right? What's it like?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07334",
   "en": "Jump Zero's a long way from home. What was it like?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07335",
   "en": "I wanted to get to know you a little better, that's all. Thanks for the talk, Kaidan. ",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07336",
   "en": "I didn't say I did this for the whole crew. We should talk again.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07337",
   "en": "No. No, I don't. We'll talk again later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07338",
   "en": "I pretty much gave up waiting for the good part.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07339",
   "en": "Is there some question about how you were exposed?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07340",
   "en": "I trust you won't have any questions when whatever's coming hits the fan?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07341",
   "en": "I'm sure your letters home are very poignant. Just keep this kind of sentimentality out of the CIC.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07342",
   "en": "We're stuck in this swamp for now, Lieutenant. What's your take?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07343",
   "en": "That's not the appropriate way to address your commanding officer, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07344",
   "en": "I don't think you should be prying into my affairs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07345",
   "en": "Someone--? You're referring to our young Prothean expert?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07346",
   "en": "You seem awfully worried about my personal affairs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07347",
   "en": "Look, you didn't want to talk about Liara, did you? What's your real issue?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07348",
   "en": "Alenko, if you have one failure, it's an inability to speak directly.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07349",
   "en": "Talk to me, Kaidan. You've got a little black raincloud sitting over your head.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07350",
   "en": "I'm tired of this, Lieutenant. I don't care if you have a problem with me chatting up Liara. It's none of your business.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07351",
   "en": "This a personal observation, Kaidan?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07352",
   "en": "We haven't had much off-duty time to talk. You have an issue with how things are going?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07353",
   "en": "I'm listening. Tell me why you feel the need to speak up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07354",
   "en": "I'm your commanding officer, Alenko. Are you questioning the way I handle things?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07355",
   "en": "Nothing more out of you, Alenko. Dismissed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07356",
   "en": "Lieutenant, I'm sure you have duties to attend to.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07357",
   "en": "You always this cautious with a sure thing?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07358",
   "en": "I'm glad you're here. It was a frustrating trip before we were grounded.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07359",
   "en": "I'm in no mood to discuss this, Alenko.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07360",
   "en": "I'm sorry. I do appreciate that you're here.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07361",
   "en": "I don't have time to coddle you, Lieutenant. Fun's fun, but my command is on the line.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07362",
   "en": "Just trying to get a sense of where the crew's at. Thoughts?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07363",
   "en": "\"Melting pot\" is inadequate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07364",
   "en": "Big club. Why keep humans out?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07365",
   "en": "It's all right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07366",
   "en": "That would be unprofessional.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07367",
   "en": "Highly inappropriate.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07368",
   "en": "An old-fashioned view.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07369",
   "en": "Zip it, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07370",
   "en": "What did they train you for?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07371",
   "en": "Just be ready.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07372",
   "en": "What's the survival rate?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07373",
   "en": "You doubt it was accidental?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07374",
   "en": "Jump Zero",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07375",
   "en": "Sounds rough. Go on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07376",
   "en": "No, just you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07377",
   "en": "Personal crap? Not interested.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07378",
   "en": "\"Shepard\"? How informal.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07379",
   "en": "Are you concerned for me?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07380",
   "en": "I don't need approval.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07381",
   "en": "That's my business, Alenko.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07382",
   "en": "Are you jealous?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07383",
   "en": "I think I've heard enough.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07384",
   "en": "I'm here, aren't I?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07385",
   "en": "I don't need this aggravation.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07386",
   "en": "No. Cut to the chase.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07387",
   "en": "Bad experience?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07388",
   "en": "What's your logic?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07389",
   "en": "That's right.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07390",
   "en": "Then keep quiet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07391",
   "en": "We're not out for long.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07392",
   "en": "Not now, Lieutenant.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07393",
   "en": "Stop being so precious, goof.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07394",
   "en": "You're not. I'm just upset.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07395",
   "en": "Sorry I snapped.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07396",
   "en": "Make it two.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07397",
   "en": "Looking for personal input.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07398",
   "en": "Sorry. I'm not looking to dump any baggage, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07399",
   "en": "You know the records about the biotic training out on Jump Zero? They're all classified. Because the Alliance made mistakes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07400",
   "en": "After first contact, Conatix was set up to track element zero exposures and develop implants for humans.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07401",
   "en": "Once we had an embassy on the Citadel, Conatix could bring in \"experts\" instead of taking it slow.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07402",
   "en": "Yeah, you could say that. Our instructor was a turian by the name of Commander Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07403",
   "en": "I told him my dad wasn't in the war. He'd retired to Vancouver. My family had an inland home that matured to new beachfront.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07404",
   "en": "Vyrnnus had it in for me after that. He cut corners, pushed hard. I mean, you either came out a superman or a wreck. And a lot of kids snapped. A few died.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07405",
   "en": "He hurt a girl. Broke her arm.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07406",
   "en": "Like an idiot, I stood up. Didn't know what I was gonna do. Just something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07407",
   "en": "And Vyrnnus lost it. Beat the crap out of me. Kept shouting how they should have bombed us back to the stone age. That's when the knife came up.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07408",
   "en": "A military-issue talon. Right in my face.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07409",
   "en": " I cut loose. Full biotic kick, right in the teeth. Almost as strong as I can manage now. At seventeen, that's something.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07410",
   "en": "He didn't have time to hate it. I killed him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07411",
   "en": "Snapped his neck. They probably could've saved him, if they got him to an infirmary quick enough. But they didn't.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07412",
   "en": "Caused a stir when they shipped him home. BAaT training was shut down. Conatix folded a couple years later.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07413",
   "en": "The point of all this--I guess--is that when you cut corners, it's not always obvious who pays for it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07414",
   "en": "I'm thirty-two, Shepard. You don't serve as long as I have without coming to terms with yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07415",
   "en": "You also learn that if someone is special to you, you help them. Try to keep them from making mistakes.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07416",
   "en": "I got some signals. Maybe some static too, I guess.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07417",
   "en": "If I'm out of line, just say the word.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07418",
   "en": "When someone important to you is up on a ledge, you help them. Keep them from mistakes better made by a kid.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07419",
   "en": "Not as much as it shocked Vyrnnus. It killed him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07420",
   "en": "Get your knuckles rapped a few times, Lieutenant?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07421",
   "en": "I don't see you snapping very easily. What finally did it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07422",
   "en": "Sat down by a kid. Vyrnnus must have hated that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07423",
   "en": "Am I supposed to talk you down now or something? Because I'm not so good at therapy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07424",
   "en": "Special, huh?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07425",
   "en": "So you think you have leave to talk like we're more than officers?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07426",
   "en": "You're not out of line, Kaidan. But there are regs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07427",
   "en": "Now isn't the ideal time. But I want to talk about this, Kaidan.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07428",
   "en": "Sorry, Kaidan. This was just a battlefield thing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07429",
   "en": "So why are you telling me this? Are you saying I'm cutting corners somewhere?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07430",
   "en": "Tapping that deep must have shocked the hell out of you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07431",
   "en": "Blowhards are easy to brush off. How'd he finally get under your skin?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07432",
   "en": "You had a bad teacher?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07433",
   "en": "He finally got to you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07434",
   "en": "Impressive.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07435",
   "en": "That must have scared you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07436",
   "en": "This the part where I fix you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07437",
   "en": "I don't see the connection.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07438",
   "en": "\"Special?\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07439",
   "en": "You're assuming a lot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07440",
   "en": "You're not.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07441",
   "en": "I'm interested, but not now.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07442",
   "en": "You're out of line.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07443",
   "en": "Yeah, that's the official name. Biggest and farthest facility we had for decades. Right on the termination shock, the outer edge of the solar system.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07444",
   "en": "No issue, Shepard. At least, not when you're around.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07445",
   "en": "They didn't know where to start. Hell, it took a couple years to even link biotics and eezo.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07446",
   "en": "Forget trying to get the kids to move stuff. They had trouble just helping them not break their own limbs.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07447",
   "en": "They were afraid of what people back home would think. Asking the turians for help when we'd just fought a war with them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07448",
   "en": "Yes, but the company didn't go through the Citadel. It would have made Earth look weak. So they discreetly hired some turian mercenaries.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07449",
   "en": "It wasn't best for us. They brought in an ex-military turian named Commander Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07450",
   "en": "To introduce himself, he liked to say, \"I was at the helm of the dreadnought that killed your father.\"",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07451",
   "en": "I get you, Shepard. I don't make a habit of complicating the chain of command.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07452",
   "en": "Just think about what I said.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07453",
   "en": "Sorry. Not sure where I stand. You seem a bit, uh, distracted. By someone.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07454",
   "en": "I don't want to distract you too much. The deeper we get into this mess, the bigger it seems.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07455",
   "en": "I'm just looking for an ear. The debriefing wasn't the right place to say how ridiculous this is.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07456",
   "en": "Seems like every other race in the galaxy is wrapped up in their own problems. They don't want to see what's coming.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07457",
   "en": "We're out here trying to save everyone. We can worry about who's king after the dust settles.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07458",
   "en": "I don't think many of them even want to. A lot of people don't understand that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07459",
   "en": "Resentment? Against aliens? I'm not-- What makes you think that?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07460",
   "en": "I mean, it's only been 26 years since first contact. That's not a lot of time to understand them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07461",
   "en": "It was Vyrnnus who made me see how human aliens are. They're not different or special. They're jerks and saints, just like us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07462",
   "en": "Hell, by the time I got payback, I didn't even want it anymore.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07463",
   "en": "It's funny. I'm not sure which of us got the worst of what happened.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07464",
   "en": "I'm not upset he's dead. Just sorry I killed him. I wasn't prepared for that. I dropped out of sight for a bit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07465",
   "en": "I didn't. Not at the time. I wasn't upset he was dead, but I was sorry that I'd killed him. So I dropped out of sight for a bit.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07466",
   "en": "They let me go. I guess they wanted it to blow over as much as I did. I came back on my terms, because I wanted to serve.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07467",
   "en": "So yeah, I hated that turian. But he wasn't \"a turian\" to me. He was Vyrnnus.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07468",
   "en": "Shepard, I outgrew the blame game years ago. If the Alliance is missing its chance, it's because of men like Udina. Not the rest of the galaxy holding it back.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07469",
   "en": "We're not doing the galaxy any favors if we try to force our way into a seat at the grown-up table.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07470",
   "en": "They aren't-- malicious. They're just slow to change. My story doesn't get any better if Vyrnnus is a good guy.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07471",
   "en": "Look, Shepard, you're in command and we'll all follow your lead. But don't ream me out for having an opinion.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07472",
   "en": "I thought we respected each other more than that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07473",
   "en": "Yeah. I think we are. It's too bad we....",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07474",
   "en": "It's just too bad. Commander.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07475",
   "en": "I'm here, Shepard. I'm not going anywhere.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07476",
   "en": "Look, I can't deny they've been reluctant to step up. But with everything we've dumped in their laps...",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07477",
   "en": "Sometimes you just get overwhelmed. You don't know what to do, so you don't do anything. I know I was paralyzed after Jump Zero.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u07478",
   "en": "That's a low bar for them to be tripping on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockerk_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_09kaidan_DS2_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
